<title>USA: 1st Bergen Bancorp sets stock buyback.</title>
<headline>1st Bergen Bancorp sets stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>WOODRIDGE, N.J. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1st Bergen Bancorp said on Thursday its board of directors had authorized a stock repurchase program, subject to approval of the Office of Thrift Supervision.</p>
<p>Under the program, the company will seek to repurchase up to 5 percent of its outstanding stock, or up to 158,700 shares, the company said.</p>
